{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1122.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"f680504df497d2812e1beea794fd311aaeb86e82834ed366267d817811648e75","ja":"みんな、ちょっといいか？\nこの資料を見て欲しいんだ！","zh":"大家，能占用一点时间吗？\n想让大家看一下这份资料！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1122.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"3d40aa55902cc59772b0fc47c2859db86c9594f0ed52bc8aecd801ab98d764aa","ja":"あら、次の収録の台本ね。\nえーっと……『アイドル対抗早口言葉大会』？","zh":"哎呀，是下次录制的台本呢。\n我看看……《偶像对抗绕口令大赛》？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1122.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"04efd0d6d1a06b44f4138f94b74604a9335df0505571f757c4dd55a3ff12fc87","ja":"ああ！　詳しいことは後で説明があるらしいんだけど、\n一足先に見せたくってさ！","zh":"啊！详细情况之后好像会有说明，\n不过我想抢先给你看看嘛！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1122.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"7f8db42e992723b8caca877679099e602e5c8a98302bd63ba7cfef25c142d987","ja":"ジュリアさん……なんだか、すごく……\nうれしそう……？","zh":"茱莉亚先生……总觉得，好像……\n特别开心……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1122.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"e0f94569d221c533673487875ddac1516a125f507391a34413fd17ab540d064a","ja":"そうですね。それに、なんだか\n熱くなっているみたいです……めらめら。","zh":"是的呢。而且，感觉好像\n变得炽热起来了……熊熊燃烧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1122.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"162558d66ae64dbf29403b1ebec46a36b78ca68dabd8fd480bc63f1aba2221f2","ja":"熱くもなるさ！\n絶好の名誉挽回のチャンスなんだからな！","zh":"当然会热血沸腾啊！\n毕竟这可是挽回名誉的绝好机会！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1122.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"aac6927e56d0d779187af758c269c806a2d9ab9ec48d3c055db3189306b7191b","ja":"何度あのWEB番組の失敗を夢に見て、苦しんだか……\nううっ、ハズすぎる……！","zh":"我多少次梦见那个网络节目的失误，痛苦不已啊……\n呜呜，太丢脸了……！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1122.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"00d6a0cd71d293ff6991c7201467365e00a947f5631b3e022c109af057a76c42","ja":"ジュリアちゃん、最後に噛んだこと、気にしてたのね。\nええと……とってもかわいかったと思うけど……。","zh":"茱莉亚原来很介意最后吃螺丝的事啊。\n那个……我觉得非常可爱就是了……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1122.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"022882d9c753ee84ad0d9f8045772b80e03387ce5b5d5aa3b03b7f34f32a10b1","ja":"だから、それがハズいんだって！　ファンレターでも\n「かわいかったでしゅ」なんていじられてさ～！","zh":"所以说，那样才难为情啊！粉丝信里甚至\n还调侃我“好可爱呐～”！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1122.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"7edf143adbb1ab3f1beba7197654cd7b84c3e23b199fea9ab32db0aaacd7019a","ja":"見てろよ。このバラエティ番組しちゅえ……\n出演で、あたしのイメージを覆してみせるからなっ！","zh":"你就看好了。借着上这个综艺节目的机……\n机会，我一定要彻底颠覆大家对我的固有印象！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
